{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 Calibri;}}\f0\fs22 {\pard\qc\sa240\b\fs44 KliqPrint\par}{\pard\sa120\fs22 Click \u183? Design \u183? Print \u183? Deliver\par}{\pard\sa120\fs22 Brand Documents Pack\par}{\pard\sa120\fs22 This document contains About Us, Contact Us, Privacy Policy, Terms of Use, Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs), Return & Refund Policy, and Sitemap.\par}{\pard\sa120\fs22 Replace placeholders such as [Your Contact Number], [Your Email Address], [Your Office / Factory Address], [Your Working Hours], [3/7], and [DD/MM/YYYY] before publishing.\par}{\page}{\pard\sb400\sa160\b\fs32 About Us\par}{\pard\sa120\fs22 KliqPrint is a professional printing, signage, branding and display solutions company committed to helping businesses create a strong and impactful visual presence. We provide high-quality customized printing solutions for businesses, institutions, retailers, event organizers, advertising agencies and individuals.\par}{\pard\sa120\fs22 With a focus on quality, customization and reliable service, we combine modern printing technology with experienced production and finishing to deliver products that meet diverse branding, promotional and display requirements.\par}{\pard\sa120\fs22 Our product range includes custom flags, advertising flags, banners, display stands, signs & decals, table covers & displays, asset tags, marketing materials and accessories. From a single customized requirement to bulk commercial orders, our team works closely with customers from design and artwork preparation through production and final delivery.\par}{\pard\sb240\sa80\b\fs26 Why Choose KliqPrint?\par}{\pard\li360\sa40\fs22 \u8226? Customized Printing Solutions tailored to your branding and application\par}{\pard\li360\sa40\fs22 \u8226? Modern Printing Technology for sharp graphics and vibrant colours\par}{\pard\li360\sa40\fs22 \u8226? Wide Product Range for indoor, outdoor, retail, corporate and event use\par}{\pard\li360\sa40\fs22 \u8226? Quality Materials & Finishing for a professional appearance\par}{\pard\li360\sa40\fs22 \u8226? Bulk & Business Orders supported with scalable production\par}{\pard\li360\sa40\fs22 \u8226? Design & Artwork Assistance to help turn ideas into print-ready products\par}{\pard\li360\sa40\fs22 \u8226? Reliable Service & Delivery with a focus on customer satisfaction\par}{\pard\sa120\fs22 At KliqPrint, our goal is simple: Click. Design. Print. Deliver. We make customized printing convenient by bringing design, production and finishing together under one roof.\par}{\pard\sa120\fs22 Whether you need branding for your business, promotional displays for an event, custom flags, signage or everyday marketing materials, KliqPrint is your partner for professional print and display solutions.\par}{\page}{\pard\sb400\sa160\b\fs32 Contact Us\par}{\pard\sa120\fs22 We'd love to hear from you! Whether you need a custom printing quotation, product information, bulk order pricing, artwork assistance or help choosing the right printing solution, the KliqPrint team is ready to assist you.\par}{\pard\sb240\sa80\b\fs26 Get in Touch\par}{\pard\sa120\fs22 KliqPrint \u8211? Click \u8226? Design \u8226? Print \u8226? Deliver\par}{\pard\li360\sa40\fs22 \u8226? Phone / WhatsApp: [Your Contact Number]\par}{\pard\li360\sa40\fs22 \u8226? Email: [Your Email Address]\par}{\pard\li360\sa40\fs22 \u8226? Address: [Your Office / Factory Address]\par}{\pard\li360\sa40\fs22 \u8226? Business Hours: [Monday\u8211?Saturday, Your Working Hours]\par}{\pard\sb240\sa80\b\fs26 Custom & Bulk Order Enquiries\par}{\pard\sa120\fs22 Looking for custom flags, banners, signage, display stands, table covers, marketing materials or other customized printing products? Share your required product, size, quantity, artwork and delivery location, and our team will provide the appropriate solution and quotation.\par}{\pard\sb240\sa80\b\fs26 Send Us an Enquiry\par}{\pard\sa120\fs22 Have a question or project in mind? Contact us today and our team will get back to you as soon as possible.\par}{\pard\sa120\fs22 KliqPrint \u8212? Your Partner for Custom Printing, Signage & Display Solutions.\par}{\page}{\pard\sb400\sa160\b\fs32 Privacy Policy\par}{\pard\sa120\fs22 At KliqPrint, we respect your privacy and are committed to protecting the personal information you share with us. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, store and protect information when you visit our website, contact us, request a quotation or purchase our products and services.\par}{\pard\sb240\sa80\b\fs26 Information We Collect\par}{\pard\sa120\fs22 We may collect information such as your name, company name, phone number, email address, billing and delivery address, order details, enquiry information and artwork or files submitted for customized printing.\par}{\pard\sa120\fs22 We may also collect certain technical information when you use our website, including browser type, device information, IP address, pages visited and cookies or similar technologies.\par}{\pard\sb240\sa80\b\fs26 How We Use Your Information\par}{\pard\sa120\fs22 We may use your information to:\par}{\pard\li360\sa40\fs22 \u8226? Process and fulfil orders\par}{\pard\li360\sa40\fs22 \u8226? Prepare quotations and respond to enquiries\par}{\pard\li360\sa40\fs22 \u8226? Provide customized printing and design services\par}{\pard\li360\sa40\fs22 \u8226? Communicate order, payment, production and delivery updates\par}{\pard\li360\sa40\fs22 \u8226? Provide customer support\par}{\pard\li360\sa40\fs22 \u8226? Improve our website, products and services\par}{\pard\li360\sa40\fs22 \u8226? Maintain business and transaction records\par}{\pard\li360\sa40\fs22 \u8226? Prevent fraud, misuse and security incidents\par}{\pard\li360\sa40\fs22 \u8226? Send promotional communications where permitted by applicable law\par}{\pard\sb240\sa80\b\fs26 Payment Information\par}{\pard\sa120\fs22 Payments may be processed through third-party payment gateways or financial institutions. KliqPrint does not intentionally store complete card details, UPI PINs, banking passwords or other sensitive payment authentication information on its own systems.\par}{\pard\sb240\sa80\b\fs26 Cookies\par}{\pard\sa120\fs22 Our website may use cookies and similar technologies to improve functionality, understand website usage and enhance your browsing experience. You can control or disable cookies through your browser settings, although certain website features may not function properly as a result.\par}{\pard\sb240\sa80\b\fs26 Sharing of Information\par}{\pard\sa120\fs22 We do not sell or rent your personal information. Information may be shared with trusted service providers where reasonably necessary to operate our business, including payment processors, logistics and courier partners, website or technology providers and other service providers assisting with order fulfilment.\par}{\pard\sa120\fs22 We may also disclose information where required by applicable law, regulation, legal process or government authority.\par}{\pard\sb240\sa80\b\fs26 Data Security\par}{\pard\sa120\fs22 We take reasonable administrative and technical measures to protect personal information against unauthorized access, misuse, alteration, disclosure or loss. However, no internet-based transmission or electronic storage system can be guaranteed to be completely secure.\par}{\pard\sb240\sa80\b\fs26 Data Retention\par}{\pard\sa120\fs22 We retain personal information only for as long as reasonably necessary for the purposes for which it was collected, including order fulfilment, customer support, accounting, legal and regulatory requirements.\par}{\pard\sb240\sa80\b\fs26 Your Rights\par}{\pard\sa120\fs22 Subject to applicable law, you may contact us to request access to, correction of or deletion of your personal information, or to raise questions regarding how your information is handled.\par}{\pard\sb240\sa80\b\fs26 Third-Party Links\par}{\pard\sa120\fs22 Our website may contain links to third-party websites or services. KliqPrint is not responsible for the privacy practices, security or content of those third-party websites.\par}{\pard\sb240\sa80\b\fs26 Changes to This Privacy Policy\par}{\pard\sa120\fs22 We may update this Privacy Policy periodically to reflect changes in our business practices, website functionality or applicable legal requirements. The updated version will be posted on this page with a revised effective date.\par}{\pard\sb240\sa80\b\fs26 Contact Us\par}{\pard\sa120\fs22 For questions or concerns regarding this Privacy Policy or your personal information, please contact:\par}{\pard\sa120\fs22 KliqPrint\par}{\pard\li360\sa40\fs22 \u8226? Email: [Your Email Address]\par}{\pard\li360\sa40\fs22 \u8226? Phone / WhatsApp: [Your Contact Number]\par}{\pard\li360\sa40\fs22 \u8226? Address: [Your Registered Business Address]\par}{\pard\sa120\fs22 Effective Date: [DD/MM/YYYY]\par}{\page}{\pard\sb400\sa160\b\fs32 Terms of Use\par}{\pard\sa120\fs22 Welcome to KliqPrint. These Terms of Use govern your access to and use of our website, products and services. By accessing our website, submitting an enquiry or placing an order, you agree to these terms.\par}{\pard\sb240\sa80\b\fs26 Products & Services\par}{\pard\sa120\fs22 KliqPrint provides custom printing, flags, banners, signage, display stands, table covers, marketing materials, accessories and related printing and branding solutions. Product specifications, colours, sizes, materials and availability may vary depending on the selected product and customization requirements.\par}{\pard\sb240\sa80\b\fs26 Orders & Customization\par}{\pard\sa120\fs22 Customers are responsible for providing accurate information regarding size, quantity, design, text, colours, artwork and other specifications before confirming an order.\par}{\pard\sa120\fs22 For customized products, production may begin after approval of the artwork, specifications and applicable payment. Once customization or production has started, changes or cancellations may not always be possible.\par}{\pard\sb240\sa80\b\fs26 Artwork & Customer-Supplied Content\par}{\pard\sa120\fs22 Customers must ensure that they have the necessary rights and permissions to use any logos, photographs, trademarks, designs, text or other artwork submitted to KliqPrint.\par}{\pard\sa120\fs22 By submitting artwork, the customer authorizes KliqPrint to use the supplied material solely as reasonably necessary to produce the requested products or services.\par}{\pard\sb240\sa80\b\fs26 Colours & Product Appearance\par}{\pard\sa120\fs22 We make reasonable efforts to reproduce colours and designs accurately. However, slight variations may occur due to differences in screens, printing processes, materials, inks, lighting and production batches. Such reasonable variations may not be considered manufacturing defects.\par}{\pard\sb240\sa80\b\fs26 Pricing & Payment\par}{\pard\sa120\fs22 Prices may vary depending on product specifications, quantity, customization, taxes, shipping and other requirements. The applicable price will be communicated or displayed before order confirmation.\par}{\pard\sa120\fs22 Orders may require full or partial payment before production or dispatch.\par}{\pard\sb240\sa80\b\fs26 Shipping & Delivery\par}{\pard\sa120\fs22 Estimated production and delivery timelines are provided in good faith. Delivery times may vary due to order complexity, courier operations, location, weather, public holidays or circumstances beyond our reasonable control.\par}{\pard\sa120\fs22 Customers are responsible for providing a complete and accurate delivery address and contact information.\par}{\pard\sb240\sa80\b\fs26 Returns, Cancellations & Refunds\par}{\pard\sa120\fs22 Returns, cancellations and refunds are subject to our applicable Return, Refund and Cancellation Policy.\par}{\pard\sa120\fs22 Customized, personalized or made-to-order products may not be eligible for return or cancellation once production has started, except where the product received is defective, damaged, incorrect or otherwise eligible under applicable law.\par}{\pard\sb240\sa80\b\fs26 Intellectual Property\par}{\pard\sa120\fs22 Unless otherwise stated, website content belonging to KliqPrint, including its branding, graphics, product photographs, designs, text and other original materials, is protected by applicable intellectual property laws.\par}{\pard\sa120\fs22 Such content may not be copied, reproduced, distributed or commercially used without authorization.\par}{\pard\sb240\sa80\b\fs26 Acceptable Use\par}{\pard\sa120\fs22 You agree not to misuse our website, attempt unauthorized access, interfere with website functionality, submit fraudulent information or use our services for unlawful purposes.\par}{\pard\sb240\sa80\b\fs26 Limitation of Liability\par}{\pard\sa120\fs22 To the extent permitted by applicable law, KliqPrint will not be responsible for indirect or consequential losses arising from the use of our website, products or services.\par}{\pard\sa120\fs22 Nothing in these Terms is intended to exclude or restrict any rights or liabilities that cannot legally be excluded under applicable law.\par}{\pard\sb240\sa80\b\fs26 Third-Party Services\par}{\pard\sa120\fs22 Our website or services may use or link to third-party providers, including payment gateways, courier companies and other service providers. Their respective terms and policies may apply when you use their services.\par}{\pard\sb240\sa80\b\fs26 Changes to These Terms\par}{\pard\sa120\fs22 KliqPrint may update these Terms of Use periodically. Any revised terms will become effective when published on our website unless otherwise stated.\par}{\pard\sb240\sa80\b\fs26 Governing Law\par}{\pard\sa120\fs22 These Terms will be governed by the laws of India. Any disputes will be subject to the jurisdiction of the competent courts applicable to KliqPrint's registered place of business, subject to applicable consumer protection laws.\par}{\pard\sb240\sa80\b\fs26 Contact Us\par}{\pard\sa120\fs22 For questions regarding these Terms of Use, please contact:\par}{\pard\sa120\fs22 KliqPrint\par}{\pard\li360\sa40\fs22 \u8226? Email: [Your Email Address]\par}{\pard\li360\sa40\fs22 \u8226? Phone / WhatsApp: [Your Contact Number]\par}{\pard\li360\sa40\fs22 \u8226? Address: [Your Registered Business Address]\par}{\pard\sa120\fs22 Effective Date: [DD/MM/YYYY]\par}{\page}{\pard\sb400\sa160\b\fs32 Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs)\par}{\pard\sa120\fs22 Find answers to some of the most common questions about KliqPrint products, custom printing, ordering, artwork, payments and delivery.\par}{\pard\sb240\sa80\b\fs26 1. What products does KliqPrint offer?\par}{\pard\sa120\fs22 KliqPrint provides a wide range of custom printing, signage and display solutions, including custom flags, advertising flags, banners, display stands, table covers, signs & decals, asset tags, marketing materials and accessories.\par}{\pard\sb240\sa80\b\fs26 2. Do you provide customized printing?\par}{\pard\sa120\fs22 Yes. We specialize in customized printing. You can provide your logo, artwork, text, colours, dimensions and other requirements, and our team will help prepare your product for production.\par}{\pard\sb240\sa80\b\fs26 3. Can I order products in custom sizes?\par}{\pard\sa120\fs22 Yes. Custom sizes are available for many products. Availability depends on the product, material and printing requirements.\par}{\pard\sb240\sa80\b\fs26 4. Do you accept bulk and corporate orders?\par}{\pard\sa120\fs22 Yes. We accept bulk, corporate, institutional, event and reseller orders. Contact us with the product, size, quantity and delivery location to request a quotation.\par}{\pard\sb240\sa80\b\fs26 5. How can I request a quotation?\par}{\pard\sa120\fs22 Send us your requirements through our website, email, phone or WhatsApp. For a faster quotation, please provide the product name, dimensions, quantity, artwork/design requirements and delivery location.\par}{\pard\sb240\sa80\b\fs26 6. What artwork files do you accept?\par}{\pard\sa120\fs22 Depending on the product, we may accept commonly used formats such as PDF, AI, EPS, CDR, PSD, PNG and high-resolution JPG/JPEG. Vector or high-resolution artwork is generally recommended for the best printing results.\par}{\pard\sb240\sa80\b\fs26 7. Can KliqPrint help with artwork or design?\par}{\pard\sa120\fs22 Yes. Our team can assist with basic artwork preparation, sizing and print-ready file setup, depending on the requirements of your order. Additional design charges may apply for extensive design work.\par}{\pard\sb240\sa80\b\fs26 8. Will the printed colours exactly match my screen?\par}{\pard\sa120\fs22 We make reasonable efforts to achieve accurate colour reproduction. However, slight colour variations can occur because of screen settings, printing methods, inks, materials and production batches.\par}{\pard\sb240\sa80\b\fs26 9. How long does production take?\par}{\pard\sa120\fs22 Production time depends on the product, quantity, customization and current workload. An estimated production and dispatch timeline can be provided when your order is confirmed.\par}{\pard\sb240\sa80\b\fs26 10. Do you deliver across India?\par}{\pard\sa120\fs22 Yes, we can ship orders to locations across India, subject to courier serviceability. Delivery charges and timelines may vary according to the destination, order size and shipping method.\par}{\pard\sb240\sa80\b\fs26 11. Do you accept international orders?\par}{\pard\sa120\fs22 International order availability depends on the product, quantity and destination. Contact our team with your requirements and destination country for assistance with export orders.\par}{\pard\sb240\sa80\b\fs26 12. Can I cancel or modify a customized order?\par}{\pard\sa120\fs22 Please contact us as soon as possible. Changes or cancellations may be possible before production begins. Once a customized or personalized product has entered production, cancellation or modification may not be possible.\par}{\pard\sb240\sa80\b\fs26 13. What if I receive a damaged or incorrect product?\par}{\pard\sa120\fs22 Please contact KliqPrint promptly with your order details and clear photographs or videos of the product and packaging. Our team will review the issue in accordance with the applicable return, replacement and refund policy.\par}{\pard\sb240\sa80\b\fs26 14. How can I contact KliqPrint?\par}{\pard\sa120\fs22 For product enquiries, quotations, custom orders or customer support, contact us at: Phone / WhatsApp: [Your Contact Number]; Email: [Your Email Address]; Address: [Your Business Address].\par}{\pard\sa120\fs22 KliqPrint \u8212? Click \u8226? Design \u8226? Print \u8226? Deliver\par}{\page}{\pard\sb400\sa160\b\fs32 Return & Refund Policy\par}{\pard\sa120\fs22 At KliqPrint, we are committed to delivering quality customized printing and display products. As many of our products are custom-made, personalized or produced according to specific customer requirements, returns and refunds are subject to the conditions below.\par}{\pard\sb240\sa80\b\fs26 Return Eligibility\par}{\pard\sa120\fs22 A return or replacement may be considered if:\par}{\pard\li360\sa40\fs22 \u8226? The product received is damaged or defective.\par}{\pard\li360\sa40\fs22 \u8226? You received an incorrect product, size or quantity compared with the confirmed order.\par}{\pard\li360\sa40\fs22 \u8226? There is a significant printing or manufacturing defect.\par}{\pard\li360\sa40\fs22 \u8226? The product is materially different from the specifications approved before production.\par}{\pard\sa120\fs22 Please contact us within [3/7] days of delivery to report an eligible issue.\par}{\pard\sb240\sa80\b\fs26 Customized & Personalized Products\par}{\pard\sa120\fs22 Products manufactured according to customer-specific designs, logos, artwork, sizes, colours, text or other customization requirements are generally non-returnable and non-refundable unless they are damaged, defective or materially different from the approved order.\par}{\pard\sb240\sa80\b\fs26 How to Request a Return or Replacement\par}{\pard\sa120\fs22 To report an issue, please contact our customer support team and provide:\par}{\pard\li360\sa40\fs22 \u8226? Your order number/invoice number\par}{\pard\li360\sa40\fs22 \u8226? A description of the issue\par}{\pard\li360\sa40\fs22 \u8226? Clear photographs of the product\par}{\pard\li360\sa40\fs22 \u8226? Photographs of the packaging, where relevant\par}{\pard\li360\sa40\fs22 \u8226? An unboxing video, if available\par}{\pard\sa120\fs22 Our team will review the information and advise you regarding the appropriate replacement, return or refund, where applicable.\par}{\pard\sb240\sa80\b\fs26 Non-Returnable Situations\par}{\pard\sa120\fs22 Returns may not be accepted for products that have been used, installed, altered, washed or damaged after delivery, products ordered with incorrect specifications supplied by the customer, minor colour variations caused by screens/materials/printing processes, or customized products produced according to approved artwork and specifications.\par}{\pard\sb240\sa80\b\fs26 Order Cancellation\par}{\pard\sa120\fs22 If you need to cancel an order, please contact us immediately. Orders may be cancelled before production begins, subject to the status of the order.\par}{\pard\sa120\fs22 Once printing, customization or production has started, cancellation may not be possible.\par}{\pard\sb240\sa80\b\fs26 Refunds\par}{\pard\sa120\fs22 If a refund is approved, it will generally be processed to the original payment method or another mutually agreed method. Processing time may vary depending on the payment provider or financial institution.\par}{\pard\sa120\fs22 Any applicable shipping, design, customization or production charges may be deducted where permitted and appropriate.\par}{\pard\sb240\sa80\b\fs26 Replacement\par}{\pard\sa120\fs22 Where an eligible manufacturing defect, damage or incorrect product is confirmed, KliqPrint may offer a replacement instead of a refund where appropriate.\par}{\pard\sb240\sa80\b\fs26 Shipping Damage\par}{\pard\sa120\fs22 If your package arrives visibly damaged, please take clear photographs of the outer packaging and product before disposing of the packaging. Contact us promptly so we can review the issue.\par}{\pard\sb240\sa80\b\fs26 Contact Us\par}{\pard\sa120\fs22 For return, replacement, cancellation or refund assistance, please contact:\par}{\pard\sa120\fs22 KliqPrint\par}{\pard\li360\sa40\fs22 \u8226? Phone / WhatsApp: [Your Contact Number]\par}{\pard\li360\sa40\fs22 \u8226? Email: [Your Email Address]\par}{\pard\li360\sa40\fs22 \u8226? Address: [Your Registered Business Address]\par}{\pard\sa120\fs22 Effective Date: [DD/MM/YYYY]\par}{\page}{\pard\sb400\sa160\b\fs32 Sitemap\par}{\pard\sa120\fs22 Quickly explore KliqPrint and find the products, services and information you need.\par}{\pard\sb240\sa80\b\fs26 Main Pages\par}{\pard\li360\sa40\fs22 \u8226? Home\par}{\pard\li360\sa40\fs22 \u8226? About Us\par}{\pard\li360\sa40\fs22 \u8226? Contact Us\par}{\pard\li360\sa40\fs22 \u8226? FAQs\par}{\pard\sb240\sa80\b\fs26 Products\par}{\pard\li360\sa40\fs22 \u8226? Flags\par}{\pard\li360\sa40\fs22 \u8226? Custom Flags\par}{\pard\li360\sa40\fs22 \u8226? Advertising Flags\par}{\pard\li360\sa40\fs22 \u8226? Banners\par}{\pard\li360\sa40\fs22 \u8226? Display Stands\par}{\pard\li360\sa40\fs22 \u8226? Signs & Decals\par}{\pard\li360\sa40\fs22 \u8226? Table Covers & Displays\par}{\pard\li360\sa40\fs22 \u8226? Asset Tags\par}{\pard\li360\sa40\fs22 \u8226? Marketing Materials\par}{\pard\li360\sa40\fs22 \u8226? Accessories\par}{\pard\sb240\sa80\b\fs26 Custom Printing Services\par}{\pard\li360\sa40\fs22 \u8226? Custom Design & Printing\par}{\pard\li360\sa40\fs22 \u8226? Business Branding Solutions\par}{\pard\li360\sa40\fs22 \u8226? Event & Promotional Printing\par}{\pard\li360\sa40\fs22 \u8226? Corporate & Bulk Orders\par}{\pard\li360\sa40\fs22 \u8226? Custom Size Printing\par}{\pard\li360\sa40\fs22 \u8226? Artwork & Design Assistance\par}{\pard\sb240\sa80\b\fs26 Customer Support\par}{\pard\li360\sa40\fs22 \u8226? Contact Us\par}{\pard\li360\sa40\fs22 \u8226? Request a Quote\par}{\pard\li360\sa40\fs22 \u8226? FAQs\par}{\pard\li360\sa40\fs22 \u8226? Order & Delivery Information\par}{\pard\li360\sa40\fs22 \u8226? Return & Refund Policy\par}{\pard\sb240\sa80\b\fs26 Legal & Policies\par}{\pard\li360\sa40\fs22 \u8226? Privacy Policy\par}{\pard\li360\sa40\fs22 \u8226? Terms of Use\par}{\pard\li360\sa40\fs22 \u8226? Return & Refund Policy\par}{\pard\sb240\sa80\b\fs26 Connect With KliqPrint\par}{\pard\li360\sa40\fs22 \u8226? Phone / WhatsApp\par}{\pard\li360\sa40\fs22 \u8226? Email\par}{\pard\li360\sa40\fs22 \u8226? Social Media\par}{\pard\sa120\fs22 KliqPrint \u8212? Click \u8226? Design \u8226? Print \u8226? Deliver\par}}